<title>USA: YES! stake held by Indonesia investor.</title>
<headline>YES! stake held by Indonesia investor.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Andyla Yasa, a Jakarta, Indonesia, investor said Friday he holds a 5.1 percent stake in YES! Entertainment Corp or 765,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Yasa said his latest transactions include a net 116,500 common shares bought between October 24 and December 17 at prices ranging from $7.0625 to $14.75 per share.</p>
<p>Yasa said he holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
<p>YES! is based in Pleasanton, Calif.</p>
</text>
